/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k-79-  rule splitWS(iCons(C:Int, R:IntSeq), CUR:IntSeq, ACC:ValSeq) => splitWS(R, seqConcat(CUR, iCons(C, .IntSeq)), ACC)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k-80-       requires notBool isWSC(C)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/methods.k-81-  // flush the current token to the result list iff non-empty.
