codex
Root cause is now concrete: this sandbox’s PID namespace reports a process PID that is absent from the mounted `/proc`; Lean 4.22 calls `readlink("/proc/<getpid()>/exe")`, so both Lean and Lake fail installation discovery. I’m adding a narrow audit-local preload shim that retries only that missing `/proc/<digits>/exe` lookup as `/proc/self/exe`. It does not alter candidate or reference files, and I’ll record its source, hash, compile command, and use in all Lean evidence.
apply patch
