codex
The remaining discrepancy is specific to running under the evidence recorder: its namespace PID happens to collide with an unrelated host `/proc/<pid>`, so Lean reads the wrong executable instead of getting `ENOENT`. I’m tightening the shim to map Lean’s numeric self-PID lookup directly to `/proc/self/exe`; in a normal namespace these resolve identically, while here it removes the collision.
