+
+Exact generation-time projection reconstruction
+-----------------------------------------------
+
+The exporter staging functions were applied to the frozen workspace and
+protected discovery manifest, and the resulting export.k was compiled with:
+
+$ kompile /tmp/audit-work/stage4-projection/export.k --backend haskell \
+    --main-module VERIFICATION-KLEAN-EXPORT --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
+    --output-definition /tmp/audit-work/stage4-projection/kompiled
+[exit 0; four unused-variable warnings in semantics/str.k]
+
+The generation-time producer was then applied through its dependency and
+projection functions, including the actual `-r kxExport` rewrite selection:
