+The immutable target nevertheless claims to translate a universal frozen rule:
+
+$ nl -ba /reference/klean-generation/generated/Klean4MeanAbsoluteDeviation/Lemmas.lean | sed -n '17,19p'
+    17  (forall (V : SortVal), ...)
