+    19      ∧ (∀ (M : SortFloat) (V : SortVal) (h : (isFloat (SortK.kseq ((@inj SortVal SortKItem) V) SortK.dotk)) = true), («applyBin(_,_,_)_MPY-CORE_Val_String_Val_Val» "-" V (SortVal.inj_SortFloat M) : SortVal) = (SortVal.inj_SortFloat (subF (projectFloat V) M) : SortVal))
+
+Conclusion: the generated SortVal is a strict subset of the frozen K Val
+carrier. In particular, the frozen value `str(.IntSeq)` has no generated Lean
+representation. The first universal domain lemma (and syntactically the other
+two) is therefore weakened by carrier restriction before theorem emission.
