+'pyk.klean.k2lean4' (/opt/runtimeverification-k/pyk/src/pyk/klean/k2lean4.py)
+
+This auxiliary incompatibility is not used for the verdict: the required
+generation-time producer is present and hash-authentic, its exact projection
+was reconstructed, and the defect is visible directly in the selected output.

